{\\lambda x},\\,{y}^{″}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}-\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}-2{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda -2) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda -2 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda +1)(\\lambda -2)=0,\n$$\n\nand so the solutions of the auxiliary equation  are $\\lambda =-1$ or $\\lambda =2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129836/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4bcb5277-6d80-5cea-9688-ddb98f434093"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129836"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-90709/selection/e44ae668ba85954b8c559c79f7232a658558811084b8b28600449b87c8f56a7e" :answer/id #uuid "a83da1d1-1354-52e5-9258-e926e02ae871" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-14$ or $1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90709/selection/0ef4908675468b223fa643a2594175b770b5404964405dab2c5e0cbaadf8759d" :answer/id #uuid "cdb1ea70-b747-589b-aa8f-5b4cc8788708" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-7$ or $2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90709/selection/11573f2dde0bd99dbd0de7700a56ed07adaf52bbc60fad09ffbd5d1e259b3128" :answer/id #uuid "b64828b8-79ab-5ee7-8c70-2c95c6ec5a60" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-2$ or $7$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90709/selection/346ac093a4d8b86b2644b0e4bc312bf5af92d4f9fe3ef343f161850a77896a2f" :answer/id #uuid "76b13f4f-4a62-5a8f-8e3d-bc4950693aa9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-4$ or $9$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90709/selection/635d093bca01ee270326a51a45824cb87a1a28f91aae6f6f7531eaa1cab8569a" :answer/id #uuid "b1b8af8b-5341-5fcc-bd84-43c2214e8230" :answer/type :answ