the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}-2{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -2) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -2.\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda +2)(\\lambda -1)=0,\n$$\n\nand so $\\lambda =-2$ or $\\lambda =1.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-2x}+B{e}^{x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130114/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe7e5c4f-6ac0-58e8-8b95-fe5a2230341c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130114"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-7782/selection/7968ef6bae0321834134254ce61a39a0d9a704be9cc2e840a424ca6b720223b6" :answer/id #uuid "bf89a5b1-f5b7-58f7-b7bd-d8f74d406e10" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{-3x}+B{e}^{-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7782/selection/603c8fcc5a8da68425e8577eb4ba464dbeeda10d3dbd744f44803a7f8bff5f26" :answer/id #uuid "deb16d9f-0802-5aaf-b3a0-2c256d684198" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{-3x}+B{e}^{2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7782/selection/5cd8c01a5e907718d92e79864016af86060c55cf850d717338010336b2bda9e2" :answer/id #uuid "949de324-fa3b-5141-a7a8-ab80430ef4dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{-6x}+B{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7782/selection/41d6b71fcda2fda36c740df7f4ec691c8d0ea57106d6798c1ebf8a9a3ccc06f2" :answer/id #uuid "8ef8ba14-809f-5819-868d-938bc628c8ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{6x}+B{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7782/selection/e066360702069666e1a8c402612c003a7fb7b44fc2e0ad8e3140a0f95e6f3085" :answer/id #uuid "6c141035-9a1f-5906-9df7-355bf3167885" :answer/type :answer.type/math :an