9fb3ceb57ac01903cabe02bbedfd8490960f256d6" "q-90719/selection/45a5fe75ec9cd95ed8be31b9029e79de6d730153d50dd5466273148709d82c60"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-90719" :question/id #uuid "980eb33b-6827-5343-b7cc-71c35035810a" :question/math-academy-id "q-90719" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-8\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+15y=0.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}-8\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}+15{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}-8\\lambda +15) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}-8\\lambda +15=0.\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda -3)(\\lambda -5)=0,\n$$\n\nand so $\\lambda =3$ or $\\lambda =5.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{3x}+B{e}^{5x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-90719/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe7e5c4f-6ac0-58e8-8b95-fe5a2230341c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-90719"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-7783/selection/92633b12b14127e16e4c990a93f5a08efef6bcd04ef9b7472468a75decc14112" :answer/id #uuid "595d0e35-3ee2-581f-ae00-dbd47e89aa42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{4x}+B{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7783/selection/6e374137d9417edc1e460ab62bd6e6fdfe536b5e5694079dbcf1b1a7bbd1c4d5" :answer/id #uuid "f2aee4cd-1134-52ba-9ce5-83e2ce9788d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{-3x}+B{e}^{3x}" :db/ensure