{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+2\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}-3{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda -3) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda -3=0.\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda +3)(\\lambda -1)=0,\n$$\n\nand so $\\lambda =-3$ or $\\lambda =1.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-3x}+B{e}^{x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-7783/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe7e5c4f-6ac0-58e8-8b95-fe5a2230341c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-7783"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-90729/selection/95cb4c5f865533b7107d1f4e192acefafa778f669ffa5e7fa7e4d9e9b3b6292f" :answer/id #uuid "1e08ddab-a8ef-5ed6-8eb7-0a4e3a69da41" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4-{e}^{6x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90729/selection/21da52a3f3be5c8a3847b462edde6248ff9023aecb58632a6fa0ad5453b8b50c" :answer/id #uuid "9c8d0525-63b3-54c0-8595-155219dd5452" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{6x}+2{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90729/selection/ae451dca0cb90b1f52b42dbb8caaf404863e998afa24c644da3fd105681e7fc4" :answer/id #uuid "139da781-3c27-50b1-beb8-e122388aa95c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{6x-4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90729/selection/dc0870e06c64bf9eeecedb58fa9b3eef9d0342e7c20e9a65cbd542facc5b408b" :answer/id #uuid "d9e253ac-d8c8-5a5f-a71c-27c5fc4ae744" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{4x+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-90729/selection/bf92beedb43b361ee5ec9caa77f0c9cfdee30da5d9a858f4606867da97c7e7fa" :answer/id #uuid "32a3ae97-a078-5726-bdd3-13511b5ca4ca" :answer/type